--- 0. task title and scope boundary (as reviewed independently before the action) ---
This record discharges the *generator/tool-version + reproducible-generation* part of the PUS-C
code-generation provenance question, filed under the tool record **T19** (ASN1SCC PUS-C code
generation, tools/scripts/gen_pus_asn1.sh + tools/docker/asn1scc/).
It is **NOT** a discharge of **NC-EXT-84**, whose registered subject is the **N7 OBCP generated
flat tree** (221 files, produced by the upstream `make flat` target, not by asn1scc). NC-EXT-84
stays **OPEN** for its registered subject; the retitle/registration of this ASN1SCC-tree subject
is a scope decision for the NC owner and the PA (verifier: PA) and is **not** taken here.

